## User

A list holding n copies of an element.

## Type

type
```agda
copies : {A : Set} → ℕ → A → List A
```

## Term

```agda
copies zero    x = []
copies (suc n) x = x ∷ copies n x
```

## agda

```agda
copies-++ : {A : Set} → (n : ℕ) → (x : A) → (xs : List A) → copies n x ++ xs ≡ copies n x ++ xs
```

## agda

```agda
copies-++ zero    x []       = refl
copies-++ (suc n) x (x₁ ∷ xs) = cong (x ∷_) (copies-++ n x xs)
```

